<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεός</span></b>  (in codd. sts. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννεός</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Act.Ap.</u>
			9.7
		</span></i>, etc.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dumb,
			speechless,</i> freq. joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωφός,</span> as <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				206d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				536b4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				961b14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sens.</u>
				437a16
			</span></i>; without 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωφός, ἐνεοῖς ἀνθρώποις ὁμοίονς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					356
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				56.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				62.16
			</span></i>: acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς οὔτε ἀκούει οὔτε λαλεῖ</span>
			<i>deaf and dumb,</i> as in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.33
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εῶς</span> dub.l. in Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				6.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>senseless, stupid,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπείρους καὶ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					2.140d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of things,
				<i>useless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ ἐ. κεῖσθαι</span> ibid.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>dumbfounded, astonished,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἱστήκεισαν ἐ.</span>
			<u>Act.Ap.</u>l.c.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
